<view class="ai-page">
  <view class="top"><view class="brand ai-brand"><brand-logo class="brand-emblem-slot" />练搭子 <text class="ai-brand-detail">INTELLIGENCE</text></view></view>
  <role-switcher />
  <view class="ai-intro"><view class="ai-kicker">PERSONAL TRAINING INTELLIGENCE</view><view class="ai-heading">更懂身体，<view>更有方向。</view></view><view class="ai-lead">从饮食记录到目标预览，<view>为日常训练，多一点理解。</view></view><view class="ai-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><view class="orbit-inner"></view><view class="orbit-point"></view></view></view>
  <view class="ai-services-label"><text>你的专属工具</text><text class="ai-service-count">01 — 03</text></view>
  <view class="aibox food-box">
    <view class="row-between"><text class="ai-section-number">01 / NUTRITION</text><text class="ai-badge">功能预留</text></view>
    <view class="ai-service-title">拍照记饮食</view><view class="ai-desc">拍一餐，或从相册选一张。估算碳水、蛋白质与脂肪，确认后记入日记；授权并开启后，可自动同步教练。</view>
    <view class="photo-grid"><button class="ai-primary food-entry-button" bindtap="onFoodCamera">拍照</button><button class="ai-outline food-entry-button" bindtap="onFoodAlbum">从相册选择</button></view>
    <view class="ai-footnote">目前可选择照片并预览，营养识别、记录和自动同步尚未开放。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="aibox posture-box">
    <view class="row-between"><text class="ai-section-number">02 / POSTURE</text><text class="ai-badge">{{mode === 'demo' ? '演示体验' : '体态观察'}}</text></view>
    <view class="ai-service-title">读懂你的体态</view><view class="ai-desc">上传正面与侧面照片，观察肩颈、躯干与骨盆的可见特征。</view>
    <view class="photo-grid">
      <button class="photo-slot {{frontMediaId ? 'photo-ready' : ''}}" bindtap="onPickFront" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="photo-frame"><text>{{frontMediaId ? '✓' : '＋'}}</text></view><view class="photo-title">正面照片</view><view class="photo-sub">{{frontMediaId ? '照片已登记 · 点击重选' : '自然站立 · 全身入镜'}}</view></button>
      <button class="photo-slot {{sideMediaId ? 'photo-ready' : ''}}" bindtap="onPickSide" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="photo-frame side-frame"><text>{{sideMediaId ? '✓' : '＋'}}</text></view><view class="photo-title">侧面照片</view><view class="photo-sub">{{sideMediaId ? '照片已登记 · 点击重选' : '自然侧立 · 双脚入镜'}}</view></button>
    </view>
    <button class="ai-primary" bindtap="onScan" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">开始体态观察 <text>↗</text></button>
    <view class="ai-footnote">{{mode === 'demo' ? '演示结果使用示例数据，不代表你的体态。' : '结果用于训练参考，不能替代医疗诊断。'}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="aibox goal-box">
    <view class="row-between"><text class="ai-section-number">03 / VISION</text><text class="ai-badge">目标预览</text></view>
    <view class="ai-service-title">让目标，更具体一点</view><view class="ai-desc">以本人照片为起点，探索不同阶段的身材视觉方向。</view>
    <view class="vision-timeline"><view><text class="vision-month">02</text><text class="vision-caption">个月</text></view><view class="vision-line"></view><view><text class="vision-month">03</text><text class="vision-caption">个月</text></view><view class="vision-line"></view><view><text class="vision-month">06</text><text class="vision-caption">个月</text></view></view>
    <button class="ai-outline" bindtap="onGoalGenerate" disabled="{{busy}}">生成目标预览 <text>↗</text></button>
    <view class="ai-footnote">AI 效果图为视觉模拟，不是实际身材变化的预测或保证。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="ai-settings"><view class="row-between"><text class="ai-settings-title">体验模式</text><radio-group class="mode-group" bindchange="onModeChange"><label class="mode-item"><radio value="real" checked="{{mode === 'real'}}" color="#28744e" disabled="{{busy}}" />正式</label><label class="mode-item"><radio value="demo" checked="{{mode === 'demo'}}" color="#28744e" disabled="{{busy}}" />演示</label></radio-group></view><view class="hint">{{statusHint}}</view></view>
  <view class="aibox" wx:if="{{postureTask}}"><view class="ai-result-title">体态分析进度</view><view class="ai-desc">{{taskLabels[postureTask.status] || postureTask.status}}<text wx:if="{{postureTask.is_demo}}"> · 演示结果</text></view><view class="ai-error" wx:if="{{postureTask.error}}">{{postureTask.error.message}}</view></view>
  <view class="aibox" wx:if="{{postureReport}}"><view class="row-between"><view class="ai-result-title">体态观察报告</view><text class="ai-badge" wx:if="{{postureReport.is_demo}}">演示</text></view><view class="ai-desc">逐项观察特征，不以单一分数定义你的身体。</view><view class="item-row" wx:for="{{postureReport.items}}" wx:key="key"><text class="item-label">{{item.label}}</text><text class="item-val">{{item.conclusion_label}}</text></view><button class="ai-outline" bindtap="onCoachReview" wx:if="{{role === 'coach'}}">教练复核</button></view>
  <view class="aibox" wx:if="{{goalGroup}}"><view class="ai-result-title">你的阶段目标</view><view class="ai-desc">{{taskLabels[goalGroup.status] || goalGroup.status}}<text wx:if="{{mode === 'demo'}}"> · 演示结果</text></view><view class="node-row" wx:for="{{goalGroup.nodes}}" wx:key="key"><view class="node-main"><text>{{item.months}} 个月 · {{taskLabels[item.status] || item.status}}</text><text class="wm" wx:if="{{item.watermarked}}">导出含 AI 模拟标记</text></view><view class="node-actions"><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'failed'}}" class="mini-btn" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onRetryNode" disabled="{{busy}}">重试</button><button wx:if="{{item.result_media_id}}" class="mini-btn" data-media="{{item.result_media_id}}" bindtap="onExportNode">导出</button></view></view><button class="ai-outline" bindtap="onConsult" disabled="{{busy}}">与教练聊聊训练方案</button></view>
  <view class="aibox" wx:if="{{consultations.length}}"><view class="ai-result-title">我的咨询</view><view class="item-row" wx:for="{{consultations}}" wx:key="consultation_id"><text class="item-label">训练方案咨询</text><text class="item-val">{{taskLabels[item.status] || item.status}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="ai-bottom-note">观察 · 理解 · 行动</view><button class="linkish" bindtap="onOpenApiHint">服务与数据说明</button>
</view>
<bottom-nav active="ai" />
